    <string name="about_title">About NovaOS Mobile</string>
    <string name="about_version">Version %1$s · %2$s %3$s · Android %4$s</string>
    <string name="about_text">NovaOS Mobile is the NovaOS home screen for Android phones and tablets: clock, favorites, all apps, quick settings, TV channels and Nova Filme. Android underneath stays unchanged (updates, security); in the Android settings you can switch back to the previous home screen at any time. Free software (GPL-3.0-or-later), part of NovaOS.</string>
    <string name="about_privacy">NovaOS Mobile collects no data and shows no ads of its own. It only uses the internet when you start a channel (the stream comes directly from the broadcaster) or open Nova Filme (lists, preview pictures and videos come from YouTube in privacy-enhanced mode, with YouTube\'s ads). Favorites are stored only on this device.</string>
